+
+Top 3 maps should be under heading: Current Maps, for 2024 and later elections. Change names to “Current….” Instead of “Enacted…”
+
+Change drop down selection for partisan lean, it reads “Partisan lean, 2018-2021”. Should read 2018-2024. Also change the partisan lean legend to match.
+
+Search box allows me to use district number, i.e. D7. It advertises county and address as options but those don’t seem to work.

